D = {}
D["CH01-SET-001-ST01_V001.jpg"] = "Elevated view of a walled compound at dawn or dusk. Round thatched houses with conical roofs and blue patterned panels on their walls sit around the edges, a larger tiered building with a steep thatched roof stands at the upper right, and rows of upright poles fill a field behind. Mist lies over the open yard, and dark forest lines the horizon under a dusky sky with an orange band."
D["CH01-SET-001-ST02_V001.jpg"] = "Elevated view of a walled compound under an overcast sky. Round thatched houses with blue patterned wall panels surround a large open yard, a larger building with a stepped thatched roof and decorated facade stands at the upper right, and two small upright stakes stand in the yard. A field of poles lies behind, with a dense forest band at the horizon."
D["CH01-SET-001-ST03_V001.jpg"] = "Elevated view of the same compound type at sunset. Warm orange light falls across an open yard. Round thatched houses with blue patterned panels stand at left and right, a larger building with a central doorway and wall decoration sits at upper centre, rows of poles fill the field, and a dark forest line lies under a red-orange sky."
D["CH01-SET-001-ST04_V001.jpg"] = "Elevated view of the compound at night under a starry dark-blue sky. Tall conical thatched roofs surround the yard, a multi-level building with a pointed tower and blue patterned panels stands at upper right, several small doorways are lit, and rows of poles fill the background."
D["CH01-SET-001-ST05_V001.jpg"] = "Elevated view of the compound in heavy rain. The yard is wet and puddled, round thatched houses have dark wet roofs, blue cloths hang on walls at lower right, and a larger building with a thatched roof stands at upper centre-right. Rain falls through a grey sky with one shaft of light."
D["CHAR_ADANNA_TURNAROUND_BACK_V001_REFERENCE_VS_CANDIDATE.jpg"] = "Two-panel comparison sheet headed ADANNA TURNAROUND BACK. The left panel is the master identity reference with a portrait, detail crops and text fields (status APPROVED 2026-11-15). The right panel is a back view of a standing figure on grey, with braids in a high knot, an indigo bandeau and wrap, a diagonal leather strap, and sandals. The header marks the candidate as UNAPPROVED, PENDING CD/TD review."
D["CHAR_ADANNA_TURNAROUND_FRONT_V001_REFERENCE_VS_CANDIDATE.jpg"] = "Two-panel comparison sheet headed ADANNA TURNAROUND FRONT. The left panel is the master identity reference (status APPROVED 2026-11-15). The right panel is an annotated front reference view with a height scale marked in heads from 1 to 7.5, and labels for high knot micro-braids, right temple beads, hand-woven indigo bandeau, studded leather baldric, scabbard on the left hip, spiral pendant, bronze armlet, indigo wrapper skirt and plain leather sandals."
D["CHAR_ADANNA_TURNAROUND_LEFT_SIDE_V001_REFERENCE_VS_CANDIDATE.jpg"] = "Two-panel comparison sheet headed ADANNA TURNAROUND LEFT SIDE. The left panel is the master identity reference. The right panel is a left profile of a standing figure on grey, with braids in a knot, an indigo top and wrap, and a leather strap across the upper body. The header marks the candidate as UNAPPROVED, PENDING CD/TD review."
D["CHAR_ADANNA_TURNAROUND_THREE_QUARTER_V001_REFERENCE_VS_CANDIDATE.jpg"] = "Two-panel comparison sheet headed ADANNA TURNAROUND THREE QUARTER. The left panel is the master identity reference. The right panel is a production model sheet labelled CHARACTER ADANNA, REFERENCE VIEW THREE-QUARTER FRONT, showing a standing figure on grey with braids, an indigo top, a diagonal strap, a bronze armlet, an indigo wrap skirt and sandals."
D["COSTUME_BREAKDOWN_SHEET_V001_REFERENCE_VS_CANDIDATE.jpg"] = "Two-panel comparison sheet headed ADANNA COSTUME BREAKDOWN. The left panel is the master identity reference. The right panel is the V001 costume breakdown, marked UNAPPROVED PENDING CD, with a front figure annotated for scar on left cheek, spiral pendant, indigo wrap top, leather strap and stud, and hip-scabbard position, plus crops of temple beads and armlet. A back panel is marked UNRESOLVED NOT APPROVED, and a right-side panel says plain by design, nothing added. A lower line lists unresolved areas."
D["ENV_CH03-INT-004_THE_FORGOTTEN_KITCHEN_V001.jpg"] = "Interior of a stone-walled kitchen in dim grey light. A stone hearth with two arched openings holds a black cooking pot. Bunches of dried herbs hang from the upper wall, a niche shelf holds a jar, a round grinding stone sits on a low stone base, a wooden table stands at right, and a doorway opens onto a long corridor. A gap in the left wall shows rock outside."
D["ENV_CH03-INT-005_A_SLEEPING_ROOM_V001.jpg"] = "Interior of a small room with plastered walls. A window with wooden bars and open shutters is at left, a raised wooden platform holds a woven mat and a folded striped cloth, and a stool at right holds a jug and a small bowl. A small wall niche is in the upper right."
D["ENV_CH03-SUB-005_A_RESIDENTIAL_COURTYARD_V001.jpg"] = "Courtyard with a tree growing in a brick planter at centre. Indigo cloth hangs on a line at left against a brick wall, an open doorway sits in a stone frame behind the tree, and a shuttered wooden door is at right beside a clay jar. A stone water trough with a tap and running water sits at lower right."
D["ENV_CH03-SUB-006_THE_BACK_PLOTS_V001.jpg"] = "Back lane between walls of broken brick and dilapidated sheds with tilted roofs. Okra plants grow in the foreground, a tilted lattice frame lies at left, a laundry line carries faded cloths at right, a rusted barrel lies on a dirt mound at lower right, and terraced houses stand in the background under an overcast sky."
D["ENV_CH03-TRV-003_THE_NARROW_PASSAGES_V001.jpg"] = "Narrow alley with dark brick walls on both sides. Cloth awnings hang overhead from beams, a small barred window is set in the right wall, an arched doorway is at mid-right, and a stone-paved path runs toward a bright opening at the far end."
D["ENV_CH04-EXP-003_THE_SMALL_ISLANDS_V001.jpg"] = "Wide view of a river with many small islands. Palms and reeds grow on the islands, a larger wooded island sits at upper centre, three small wooden boats are drawn up on a sandy bank at lower right, low hills lie in the distance, and the sky is pale and overcast."
D["ENV_CH04-EXP-006_THE_CAVE_BEHIND_THE_LOW_FALLS_V001.jpg"] = "A waterfall falls in several streams across a stone ledge into a pool. Behind it is a dark rock overhang with wet walls, ferns grow on the cliff edges, a rainbow arcs at left, and wet rocks sit in the foreground."
D["ENV_CH04-INT-001_A_FISHING_SHELTER_V001.jpg"] = "Open-sided shelter with a thatched roof on wooden posts, built over a wooden deck above a river. Woven baskets, a conical trap and a long pole sit at left, a wooden board with a knife rests on the deck, nets hang from the roof beams, and a smoking rack is at right. The river and forested far bank are visible through the posts."
D["ENV_CH04-INT-002_A_RIVERBANK_HOUSE_V001.jpg"] = "Raised house on stilts over brown water, with a thatched roof and mud-plastered walls. A ladder leads up to the floor, clay pots and a bowl sit on the deck, baskets and a fish trap hang at the side, dried fish hang inside the doorway, and a dugout boat with a covered cabin lies at left beside palms."
D["ENV_CH04-INT-003_THE_CANOE_SHED_V001.jpg"] = "Long wooden shed with a plank roof and timber walls, open toward a river. Paddles hang on a wall rack, coiled rope hangs on a post, several dugout canoes rest on log supports, two buckets of dark liquid sit on the deck at lower right, and a coil of rope lies at lower left."
D["ENV_CH04-SET-002_THE_TWO_HOUSE_LANDING_V001.jpg"] = "Two raised, thatched wooden houses on either side of a reddish earth path leading into palms. A fish or leaf drying line hangs across the path, baskets stand on a plank walkway at centre, and two wooden boats sit in the water in the foreground. Mist and jungle foliage fill the background."
D["CH05-EXP-002_THE_HIDDEN_CAVE_V001.jpg"] = "Interior of a dark cave with rock walls. A shaft of light enters from an opening at the top centre, ivy hangs from an opening at left, fallen rock blocks lie in the left foreground, a thin stream runs over wet stones at lower left, and the floor is covered in dry leaves."
D["CH05-INT-001_THE_HERDERS_SHELTER_V001.jpg"] = "Stone-walled shelter with a thatched roof, built against a rock face on a dry hillside. Bedding sits on a stone ledge inside, a clay pot stands on the ground at left, a hooked rope and a long staff lean against the wall, a woven wall panel is at right, and dry grass covers the slope under a blue sky with clouds."
D["CH05-INT-002_A_VILLAGE_HOUSE_V001.jpg"] = "Interior hearth room of a stone and mud-walled house in rain. A thatched roof sheds water, a small fire burns in a stone hearth with a black pot, a shelf holds jars, a wooden bed with a fur-like cover sits in an alcove at left, a grain bowl and a small stool stand on the floor, and a plank door with an iron bar is at right. A village is visible below in the rainy distance."
D["ENV_CH05-LMK-002_THE_ABANDONED_WATCHPOST_V001.jpg"] = "Round stone tower on a grassy ridge, with a broken woven roof of poles and thatch on top, a doorway with a timber frame opening to a dark interior, a heap of stone rubble and steps at its base, and layered mountain ridges under a cloudy sky."
D["ENV_CH05-SET-002_THE_UPPER_HAMLET_V001.jpg"] = "Hamlet of stone-walled houses with thatched roofs, set on terraced slopes with low stone walls and stairways. A large open grassy area lies at centre, a thatched house stands at lower right, and mountain peaks rise behind under a grey sky."
D["ENV_CH05-SUB-003_THE_CLIMBERS_CAMP_V001.jpg"] = "Camp on a narrow rock ledge beside a steep cliff. Two lean-to shelters of poles with hide or thatch panels stand against the rock, a ring of stones holds a fire site, a coil of rope lies on the ledge, a wooden ladder leans on the rock at left, and cloud fills the valley below."
D["ENV_CH06-INT-004_A_ROOM_THAT_EXPECTS_YOU_V001.jpg"] = "Empty plain room with pale walls and a grey floor. A single bed with white sheets and a white pillow sits at right beside a bedside table holding a cup, a wooden chair faces the viewer at centre, a chest of drawers stands at left, and a wall lamp is mounted by an open door. A large window at right shows a dark night sky."
D["ENV_CH06-INT-005_THE_FORGOTTEN_ROOM_V001.jpg"] = "Dim room with a wooden floor and cracked walls. A wardrobe stands at centre with one door open and leaves on the floor in front of it, a mirror hangs on the back wall, a covered chair or sofa with a sheet stands at right, and a torn curtain hangs at the left window. Cobwebs hang from the ceiling corners, and a mantelpiece with dried plants is at far right."
